    "“Because it allows me to create solutions that help people.”" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Karena bidang ini memungkinkanku menciptakan solusi yang membantu orang lain.”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“For instance, I built an app that helps students organize their schedules.”" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Misalnya, aku pernah membuat aplikasi yang membantu pelajar mengatur jadwal mereka.”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“I am passionate about web development.”" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Aku sangat tertarik pada pengembangan web.”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“That's why web development is my passion.”" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Karena itulah pengembangan web adalah passion-ku.”"
